questions.explanation:
The **JSONPath expression** `$.customers[*].region_code` selects the `customers` array, uses the `[*]` wildcard to select every object within that array, and then retrieves the `region_code` attribute from each of those objects.

```json
{
  "customers": [
    {"id": 1, "name": "Alpha", "region_code": "US"},
    {"id": 2, "name": "Beta", "region_code": "CA"}
  ]
}
```
